.TH XML2REC "1" "April 2026" "GNU recutils 1.9.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
xml2rec \- xml to rec converter
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B xml2rec
[\fI\,OPTIONS\/\fR]... [\fI\,XML_FILE\/\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Convert XML data (in recdata format) into rec data.
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-type\fR=\fI\,TYPE\/\fR
type name for the converted records; if this
parameter is omitted then the type is inferred
from the XML structure.
.TP
\fB\-\-help\fR
print a help message and exit.
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
show version and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
Convert XML (recdata format) to rec:

  xml2rec data.xml

Convert XML with a specific record type override:

  xml2rec -t Contact data.xml

Pipe from rec2xml for round-trip conversion:

  rec2xml contacts.rec | xml2rec
